Package: flippies-sysinfo
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Create Flippies <flippies@deb.flip>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Description: System information panel for the Create Flippies PC
 System info shows the CPU, memory, swap, disk space, network address and
 traffic, and uptime of the PC in one small window.
